00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:52,720
事实上,我们的大脑就像汽车,
In fact,our brains are like cars.

280
00:14:54,020 --> 00:14:58,560
汽车是由精密零件组成工作网络的机器,
Cars are machines filled with networks of precision parts,

281
