每个零件都有自己的功能,
each with a specific function,

282
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:04,660
被装配起来成为完整的系统。
but together forming one complete system.

283
00:15:04,660 --> 00:15:08,400
但是汽车并不是独立的物体。
But cars are not meant to be stand-alone objects.

284
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:11,240
[引擎发动]
[ Engine revs ]

285
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:17,870
它需要和其他车辆共享道路,
They are meant to share the road with other vehicles,

286
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:23,780
就像我们的大脑可以与其他大脑相互交流,
just as our brains are designed to interact with other brains,

287
00:15:23,780 --> 00:15:25,550
Mike觉得
and this,Mike feels,

288
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:28,550
这层就是自由意志存在的地方--
is the layer where free will exists --

289
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:32,060
个人责任层面。
the level of personal responsibility.

290
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:34,460
如果世界上只有你一个人,
If you were the only person in the world,

291
00:15:34,460 --> 00:15:37,030
就没有个人责任这一概念,
there's no concept of personal responsibility.

292
00:15:37,030 --> 00:15:39,530
有什么意义呢？没任何意义,
What's it mean? It doesn't mean anything.

293
00:15:39,530 --> 00:15:41,970
你不需要对任何人产生个人责任,
There's no one else to be personally responsible to.

294
00:15:41,970 --> 00:15:45,670
它就会在缺少与这个世界上的
So it is developed out of the interactions

295
00:15:45,670 --> 00:15:48,670
其他人互动的情况下发展,
that occur when there's more than one person.

296
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:52,110
弗里曼: 无论何时做一个决定,
Freeman: Whenever we make a decision,

